    {
      "id": "claim_e51c2d73878144c5a8f23acc02955fba",
      "statement": "website/netlify/functions/counter.mjs is a Netlify Function v2 exposed at POST /api/counter that increments and returns a single pageviews counter stored via @netlify/blobs (getStore with consistency: 'strong'), rejects non-POST methods with 405, responds with Cache-Control: no-store, and intentionally performs a non-atomic read-modify-write that the code comments accept as tolerable for a simple visit counter while persisting no IP address, timestamp, or user agent.",
